    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the fascinating world of the zodiac signs as you embark on a journey to win the heart of the boy of your dreams.<br><br>Immerse yourself in a unique experience where each answer will not only unveil his personality but also the intriguing characteristics linked to his astrological sign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this thrilling game, each question is designed to unravel the mysteries of the zodiac, allowing you to get to know these boys in an entirely new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326960/extras/8651b0c6afba525c39c17f6c2915489a.avif?t=1732744460\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unlock images of the boys on the beach and discover their zodiac traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-As you progress, questions become more personal and linked to their zodiac sign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Different endings depending on how many questions you answer and how you interpret astrological signals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unlock the secret features of each boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover the secret and spicy question the boys will ask you in question 150, related to astrology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you able to decipher the astrological signs and earn their trust? Find out in this new and exciting adventure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the fascinating world of the zodiac signs as you embark on a journey to win the heart of the boy of your dreams.<br><br>Immerse yourself in a unique experience where each answer will not only unveil his personality but also the intriguing characteristics linked to his astrological sign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this thrilling game, each question is designed to unravel the mysteries of the zodiac, allowing you to get to know these boys in an entirely new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326960/extras/8651b0c6afba525c39c17f6c2915489a.avif?t=1732744460\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unlock images of the boys on the beach and discover their zodiac traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-As you progress, questions become more personal and linked to their zodiac sign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Different endings depending on how many questions you answer and how you interpret astrological signals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unlock the secret features of each boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover the secret and spicy question the boys will ask you in question 150, related to astrology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you able to decipher the astrological signs and earn their trust? Find out in this new and exciting adventure.</p>",
